 ### Breaking Changes
 
+* `llama-cpp-python` has been upgraded to v0.3.2 and will need to be reinstalled if you are upgrading `ilab` from an older version. This adds support for serving models that use the new `granite` architecture, such as Granite 3.0.
+
 ### Features
 
 * A new command `ilab model upload` has been introduced so users can now upload their trained models to [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/) via the `ilab` CLI
